The '''Guaranteed Uber Rare Cat Campaign''' is an event that guarantees an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] will appear on the 11th roll of any 1,500 [[Cat Food]] draw.

==Event==
Drawing 11 capsules at once from the Rare Capsule machine guarantees you to receive {{Color|#FF0000|'''at least one Uber Rare character!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''This campaign will begin at 11:00am on April 11th and continue until 10:59am on April 14th.'''}}

<small>*NOTICE: This limited-time Guaranteed 11-Capsule Draw campaign will apply only to the current Rare Capsule event!</small>

