==See Also==
*[[Gacha Probability Up Campaign]]: A similar event that doubles the odds of an Uber Rare or Legend Rare dropping on any given Rare Capsule roll.

==Trivia==
*The Guaranteed Uber Rare Campaign and Gacha Probability Up Campaign are mutually exclusive and will not occur at the same time.
*Some Gacha Events are not affected by this event, such as [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]], [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] and [[RoyalFest (Gacha Event)|RoyalFest]].
*The Guaranteed Uber Rare Campaign is typically exclusive with earning Platinum Shards for doing 1,500 Cat Food rolls.

